  - elementId: rules
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 186, 340, 316]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13.5
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$teal"><strong>✓</strong></span> <strong>接口隔离</strong>：Service / Repository 均定义接口，依赖注入装配</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><span style="color:$teal"><strong>✓</strong></span> <strong>零越层调用</strong>：Controller 不引用任何 Repository 或 SQL（全量代码扫描验证）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><span style="color:$teal"><strong>✓</strong></span> <strong>统一事务</strong>：IRepositoryTransactionManager 管理跨表写入，失败整体回滚</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><span style="color:$teal"><strong>✓</strong></span> <strong>按钮不碰库</strong>：页面提交 → 控制器 → 服务 → 仓储，事件与 SQL 完全隔离</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><span style="color:$teal"><strong>✓</strong></span> <strong>五层文档</strong>：mvc-five-layer-spec.md / layered-architecture.md 固化约定</p>
